2
00:07:08,571 --> 00:07:14,571
The Grand Budapest Hotel is a comedy, drama film directed by Wes Anderson.

3
00:10:42,857 --> 00:10:48,857
The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the
wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé.

4
00:14:17,142 --> 00:14:23,142
The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune
and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.

5
